	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">President Bush, Leading Thousands in Memorial to Shuttle Crew, Says 'Mankind Is in Their Debt'</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/8_ds_64250.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/SHUTTLE_MEMORIAL_BUS0.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Led by President Bush, thousands of grieving space workers and their families, friends, neighbors and political leaders paid a solemn farewell Tuesday to the seven Columbia astronauts. "Their mission was almost complete and we lost them so close to home," Bush said.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/8_ds_64250.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
