	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">Independent Panel Probing Shuttle Disaster Surveys Debris in Texas; More Human Remains Found</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/8_ds_63599.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/SHUTTLE_INVESTIGATIO31.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Members of the independent board investigating the Columbia disaster arrived Tuesday morning to get a firsthand look at the debris being collected from across a vast stretch of countryside.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/8_ds_63599.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
