	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">U.N. Weapons Inspectors in Iraq Say They Have Found Another Empty Chemical Warhead</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/8_ds_64245.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/IRAQ_BRITAIN_SADDAM.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">U.N. arms investigators found another empty chemical warhead on Tuesday as they pressed ahead with a dozen surprise inspections, on a mission in which President Saddam Hussein, in a rare interview, said he hopes they "reach the truth."&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/8_ds_64245.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
