	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">Powell Prepares Evidence on Iraq for U.N. Presentation; France Wants More Time for Inspectors</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/8_ds_64114.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/UN_IRAQ137.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Secretary of State Colin Powell, bidding for U.N. support, is set to present evidence that Iraq has hidden large caches of weapons of mass destruction from international inspectors and defied calls on it to disarm.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/8_ds_64114.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
