	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">Both Finalists for World Trade Center Design Include Tallest Structures in World, Officials Say</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/8_ds_64295.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/ATTACKS_REDEVELOPMEN1.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Two plans featuring structures that would rise taller than any other in the world have been picked as finalists in the selection of a design to rebuild the World Trade Center, officials said Tuesday.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/8_ds_64295.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
