	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Lawmakers Formally Abolish Yugoslavia, Replacing it With a Loose Union of Serbia and Montenegro</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Lawmakers formally abolished Yugoslavia on Tuesday and replaced it with a loose union of its remaining two republics, Serbia and Montenegro, marking the final demise of the troubled Balkan federation.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/8_ds_63987.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
